2. Arthur Jensen proposed the Hierarchical model of intelligence with Level I and Level II abilities (B -> III);
3. Louis Thurstone proposed the Theory of Primary Mental Abilities with 7 primary factors (C -> IV);
4. Howard Gardner proposed the Theory of Multiple Intelligences comprising 8 autonomous intelligences (D -> I).
This corresponds exactly to (A)-(II), (B)-(III), (C)-(IV), (D)-(I).
Hence, option (C) is the correct match.
Hence, option (D) is the correct match.

